@startuml

hide footbox
title US001 - To register a user in the system

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":UserController" as UserController
participant ":UserRepository" as UserRepository

Administrator -> UI : **1** addUser(username, contact, profile)

UI -> UserController : **2** addUser(username, contact, profile)
activate UserController

UserController -> UserRepository : **3** addUser(username, contact, profile)
activate UserRepository

create "u1: User" as User
UserRepository -> User : **4** create(username, contact, profile)


UserRepository -> UserRepository : **5** validateToAdd(u1)

UserRepository --> UserController : **6** true
deactivate UserRepository

UserController --> UI : **7** success
deactivate UserController

UI --> Administrator : **8** success



@enduml